    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "I created the cure.\n\nBefore I could deliver it, the government came
        for me and chased me into the Military Quarantine Zone to take it. They interrogated
        me, demanding its location. I stayed silent\u2026 and paid the price.\n\nI\u2019m
        bleeding out as I write this. Peter, you have to finish this. The cure is
        hidden in the warehouse\u2014second stack of boxes on the right from the
        entrance.\n\nTake it. Use it. Save what's left of humanity. You\u2019re our
        last hope now. \n\nGoodbye, my old friend.              \u2014 Isaac"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
